{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：部分未标注“到时出现”的感受词仍然过密，尤其S05、S07、S11—S13，容易让观众忙于扫词，反而漏掉话语的因果关系。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的话句更短，重点通过加亮突出，观众能较快抓住每段心理变化；感受词又有不少与具体音乐时刻同步出现，音乐细节和情绪层次也比X更丰富。X的优势是把人物为什么这样想、为什么改变讲得更完整，前后心理转折的因果链也更清楚。综合边听边看的实际体验，我选Y，但它需要控制部分感受词同时出现的密度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8473d70f-d2a6-4c32-b0db-1d541f4da4be", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T212315895626Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.593, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:23:50.519777+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5a13ec2757a5f09ab0132bd75774c12560c6ed50342bc26e432818f39447cefe", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238850